WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.642
For tasks with fixed labels or exact fields, accuracy is a useful starting metric.

00:00:06.642 --> 00:00:12.602
Compare each prediction with the expected result and count the proportion that match.

00:00:12.602 --> 00:00:18.807
It is simple, but it only works when the task has a clearly defined correct output.

00:00:18.807 --> 00:00:22.022
Exact match is intentionally strict.

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:28.217
It is useful for labels and structured fields, but it can be unfair for open-ended text where several answers may be

00:00:28.217 --> 00:00:30.656
acceptable.
